  "extra_findings": [
    "F8 — exportarCsv writes every export to a single shared EXPORT_DIR/chamados.csv and re-reads it with readfile, so concurrent exports can truncate or mix each other (lib.php:125-150)",
    "F10 — fputcsv with the default backslash escape produces non-RFC-4180 output for values containing backslash before a quote (lib.php:138-144)",
